  "description": "MOCMOK crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H74 N18 O26 Sm4. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.856-4.358 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.83-112.68°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Sm4(C11H11N3O4)6(CH3OH)2. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
